# rebyld

Personal 12-week recomposition + 5K training dashboard. Client-side PWA; optional LLM adaptation via POST /api/adapt.

Keep the single-page architecture. Persist profile/layout in the documented localStorage keys. Do not rewrite this into a framework without an explicit request.
Honor .env.example; never commit secrets.

## Stack

Vanilla HTML/CSS/JS PWA · optional Node.js /api/adapt backend · localStorage state.

## Verify

`open index.html or run the Node server under server/`

## ECC workflow

1. Plan non-trivial work with the planner agent / plan skill.
2. Implement with tests first (`tdd-workflow`).
3. Review with `code-reviewer` and `security-reviewer` before merge-level changes.
4. Keep secrets out of prompts and commits. Prefer small, reviewable diffs.

## ECC install notes

- Language rules are glob-scoped; only matching files should pull them in.
- After install, `.cursor/rules` were converted to Cursor `globs`/`alwaysApply`. `ecc doctor` may report drift; do not `ecc repair` those rule files just to clear the warning.
- Cursor hooks live in `.cursor/hooks.json` and must resolve scripts under `.cursor/scripts/hooks/`.
